# 59. FORENSIC VALIDATION

Never conclude:

> "This process is malware because its name looks suspicious."

Instead ask:

```text
What is the executable path?
Who launched it?
What is its parent?
When was it created?
What does its command line contain?
What network connections exist?
What files did it access?
Does its hash match known malware?
Is it signed?
Does the timeline support the theory?
```

